    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just \"rigid expectations.\" it's the actual substance of it. if there's no truth at the end of it, then every hour i spent, every sacrifice i made, it was just a waste of time. i feel like i've been running on a treadmill for a decade and just realized there isn't even a floor underneath me. i'm just tired. i'm so tired of trying to find meaning where there isn't any.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
